{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1389","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Bicolored Segments"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given $$$n$$$ segments $$$[l_1, r_1], [l_2, r_2], \\dots, [l_n, r_n]$$$. Each segment has one of two colors: the $$$i$$$-th segment's color is $$$t_i$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's call a pair of segments $$$i$$$ and $$$j$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bad"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if the following two conditions are met:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$t_i \\ne t_j$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" the segments $$$[l_i, r_i]$$$ and $$$[l_j, r_j]$$$ intersect, embed or touch, i. e. there exists an integer $$$x$$$ such that $$$x \\in [l_i, r_i]$$$ and $$$x \\in [l_j, r_j]$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Calculate the maximum number of segments that can be selected from the given ones, so that there is no "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bad"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" pair among the selected ones."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains